 class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 会被显著压低（税局倾向选择&quot;好查&quot;的对象，因为评估成本低），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>defense</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_j^{\\text{defense}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2439em;vertical-align:-0.3948em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">defense</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 也随之下行。<strong>数据留存质量是这套公式里唯一可由平台单方面控制的乘数。</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变量</th>\n<th>影响方向</th>\n<th>工程杠杆</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被查概率</td>\n<td>与证据可复原率<strong>负相关</strong></td>\n<td>同期凭证链、下钻能力、抽样复原</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>B</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>under</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_j^{\\text{under}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2439em;vertical-align:-0.3948em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">under</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 少报基数</td>\n<td>与门槛监控、分类准确度相关</td>\n<td>实时 nexus 告警、分类版本化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 罚金率</td>\n<td>与披露时机强相关</td>\n<td>主动披露 / VDA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_j(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 利息</td>\n<td>随时间线性增长</td>\n<td>越早纠正越省</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>defense</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_j^{\\text{defense}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2439em;vertical-align:-0.3948em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">defense</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3948em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应对成本</td>\n<td>与证据集中度负相关</td>\n<td>单一证据包导出接口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最重要的推论：<strong>追诉期内的每一年敞口都是&quot;活的&quot;</strong>，直到届满才归零。风险敞口在时间上是阶梯下降函数而非常数，这给了&quot;先修最老年度&quot;的优先级依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"追诉期与罚则-三个体系的对照\">追诉期与罚则：三个体系的对照</h2><p>罚则不是&quot;统一的 20%&quot;，而由<strong>追诉期 × 主观状态 × 申报类型</strong>交叉决定。简化为单一数字会导致风险准备金严重失真。</p>\n<p>美国联邦层面，信息申报与税本身是<strong>两套独立体系</strong>。少缴税的准确性罚则按主观状态分档：一般疏忽 20%（IRC §6662），重大少报（超过正确税额 25% 或 gross receipts 的 10%）40%；信息申报不合规走 IRC §6721/§6722，按份计罚且<strong>每年通胀指数化</strong>（近年约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>310</mn><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">310–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">310–</span></span></span></span></span>340/份，来源：<a href=\"https://www.irs.gov/payments/information-return-penalties\">IRS, Information Return Penalties</a>）。追诉期一般三年（IRC §6501(a)），重大少报六年，欺诈或无申报无限期。英国则依 Finance Act 2007 Schedule 24 按行为定性（careless 15% / deliberate 70% / concealed 100%），配主动披露折减；欧盟成员国的罚则比例由<strong>国内法</strong>规定（如德国 UStG §26a），不存在统一税率——这正是多辖区敞口难量化的根源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>体系</th>\n<th>追诉期</th>\n<th>罚则结构</th>\n<th>披露折减</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>US 联邦（税）</strong></td>\n<td>3 年 / 重大少报 6 年 / 欺诈无限</td>\n<td>§6662：20% / 40%</td>\n<td>合理事由（reasonable cause）抗辩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>US 联邦（信息申报）</strong></td>\n<td>同前</td>\n<td>§6721/§6722：按份计罚，指数化</td>\n<td>合理事由抗辩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>US 州税</strong></td>\n<td>通常 3–4 年</td>\n<td>各州法，欠税额比例 + 利息</td>\n<td>州级 VDA（多州联合，经 MTC）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>UK</strong></td>\n<td>通常 4–6 年（故意更长）</td>\n<td>FA 2007 Sch. 24：15% / 70% / 100%</td>\n<td>主动披露折减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>EU 成员国</strong></td>\n<td>由各国法（常见 4–10 年）</td>\n<td>各国法（常见 10%–200% 区间）</td>\n<td>各国自愿更正程序</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个必须写进设计的事实：<strong>利息独立于罚金</strong>，按日计息（美国 IRC §6621 为联邦短期利率加 3 个百分点），罚金被抗辩掉利息仍在跑；<strong>追诉期不因平台整改而暂停</strong>，只从申报/到期日起算，所以&quot;今年开始做对&quot;不能覆盖&quot;过去三年没做对&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证据包与审计应对\">证据包与审计应对</h2><p>审计现场唯一有效的资产是<strong>同期凭证</strong>（contemporaneous records）。事后重建的推算在举证力上远弱于当期生成、固化、带版本号的记录——这是举证责任的直接推论。一个可用的证据包至少五层，且必须能按 <code>(jurisdiction, period, seller)</code> 三轴下钻：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>申报表原件及提交凭证</strong>（portal confirmation / MTD receipt），证明&quot;报了&quot;；</li>\n<li><strong>申报额计算明细</strong>——按辖区分行、按税率分档的聚合过程；</li>\n<li><strong>汇率依据</strong>——哪一期用了哪个汇率源（HMRC 月度期汇率、欧洲央行季度汇率等）；</li>\n<li><strong>Nexus 与登记状态快照</strong>——证明&quot;当期该不该收&quot;，含阈值输入数据；</li>\n<li><strong>税务分类版本</strong>——商品/服务归入哪个税率类别，以及规则当期版本。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 3、5 项最常被漏掉，也最贵。分类规则若只保留&quot;最新版本&quot;，税局挑战三年前归类时，平台拿不出当期依据，只能用今天的规则解释过去的判定——这是自证循环。工程要求是<strong>分类与汇率都版本化存档</strong>，与 <a href=\"../seller-reporting-1099/1099k-aggregation-form-selection-filing\">1099-K 数据聚合、表单选型与年度申报传输</a> 中&quot;口径层参数化&quot;同源：口径必须是可回放的参数，而非被覆盖的代码常量。</p>\n<p>留存期限按<strong>最长追诉期加缓冲</strong>设定：HMRC 要求一般保留 6 年，德国 Abgabenordnung §147 要求账簿保留 10 年，美国一般 3 年但建议按 6–7 年留存以覆盖重大少报。策略应取所涉辖区最长值统一执行——裁剪省下的存储成本远小于一次&quot;记录已过期&quot;的举证失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主动披露与补救\">主动披露与补救</h2><p>罚则矩阵里唯一可被平台主动改变的是<strong>主观状态</strong>。自愿披露协议（Voluntary Disclosure Agreement, VDA）正为此设计：美国多州可通过 Multistate Tax Commission（MTC）联合 VDA 一次性处理多州追溯欠税，换取<strong>免除罚金</strong>、回溯年数受限（常见 3–4 年），并停止后续追诉。欧盟的更正申报与英国的自愿披露折减遵循同一逻辑：越早、越完整、越主动，罚金率越低。</p>\n<p>VDA 的前置条件恰好是工程问题：<strong>必须尚未被通知审计</strong>（收到通知即丧失资格，故&quot;发现问题&quot;到&quot;提交披露&quot;的窗口极短）、<strong>必须提交完整准确的历史数据</strong>（含糊估算会被拒）、<strong>通常附合规承诺</strong>。因此关键是顺序：先建<strong>可复原的证据链</strong>，再建<strong>阈值与分类的持续监控</strong>，最后才启动披露程序。颠倒顺序——先谈 VDA 再补数据——通常以资格被拒或范围被限结束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多辖区税务风险的可治理形式是敞口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中唯一可由平台单方面压缩的因子是<strong>证据可复原率</strong>。规则面仍在收紧：欧盟 ViDA 已于 2025 年 3 月获理事会通过并分阶段适用（数字报告要求 DRR + 平台经济范围扩大），英国 MTD for Income Tax 自 2026 年 4 月启动。共同含义是<strong>申报频次上升、单次可裁量空间下降</strong>——审计应对能力必须在申报发生那一刻就固化进系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"监管申报、税务审计与多辖区风险敞口","id":"监管申报-税务审计与多辖区风险敞口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：申报义务的辖区矩阵","id":"核心概念-申报义务的辖区矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"审计触发：为什么被选中，谁举证","id":"审计触发-为什么被选中-谁举证"},{"level":2,"text":"风险敞口的量化模型","id":"风险敞口的量化模型"},{"level":2,"text":"追诉期与罚则：三个体系的对照","id":"追诉期与罚则-三个体系的对照"},{"level":2,"text":"证据包与审计应对","id":"证据包与审计应对"},{"level":2,"text":"主动披露与补救","id":"主动披露与补救"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代扣与申报税务对账及总账分录差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-tax-withholding-seller-1099-reporting/compliance-reconciliation-ops/tax-reconciliation-ledger-variance"},"next":{"title":"卖家税表争议、更正申报与代扣纠错运营","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-tax-withholding-seller-1099-reporting/compliance-reconciliation-ops/seller-dispute-correction-notice-ops"}}